ia-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\mathrm{Normal}(\\varphi_\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha,\\xi,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\xi&lt;\\eta\\to\\varphi_\\alpha(\\xi)&lt;\\varphi_\\alpha(\\eta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha,\\xi,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\xi&lt;\\eta\\to\\varphi_\\alpha(\\xi)&lt;\\varphi_\\alpha(\\eta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to\n\\bigl(\\varphi_\\alpha(\\gamma)\\le\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\\land\n\\varphi_\\alpha(\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma))=\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to\n\\bigl(\\varphi_\\alpha(\\gamma)\\le\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\\land\n\\varphi_\\alpha(\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma))=\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原文件名以兼容已有入口，结论与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"243363d27f588e48\" href=\"?note=243363d27f588e48\" title=\"18-thm-veblen-monotonicity\">18-thm-veblen-monotonicity</a> 一致。源页码和证明审阅状态沿用原记录；本轮没有新增原书页码核验或证明助理验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"tar